
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Forma Doppia | Furniture Store</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f3ed;
      color: #35291f;
    }
    header {
      background: #49382b;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; letter-spacing: 3px; }
    nav {
      background: #e8ded0;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #49382b;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .hero {
      padding: 65px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #d8c5ad;
    }
    .hero h2 { font-size: 32px; }
    .hero p { font-size: 17px; }
    .products {
      padding: 30px 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .product {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 18px auto;
      max-width: 350px;
    }
    .product img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    button {
      background: #49382b;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    footer {
      background: #49382b;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>FORMA DOPPIA</h1>
  <p>Step Up Your Comfort</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#products">Products</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <h2>Furniture That Fits Your Lifestyle</h2>
  <p>Discover comfort, style, and functionality in every piece.</p>
  <a href="#products">
    <button>Shop Now</button>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="products" id="products">
  <h2>Our Featured Products</h2>

  <div class="product">
    <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400/D8C5AD/49382B?text=Chair+Ladder" alt="Chair Ladder">
    <h3>Chair Ladder</h3>
    <p>Double-function furniture designed for comfort and convenience.</p>
    <h3>₱2,500.00</h3>
    <button onclick="alert('Product selected! Shopping cart coming next.')">
      View Product
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<footer id="contact">
  <h3>Forma Doppia Furniture</h3>
  <p>Step Up Your Comfort</p>
  <p>Thank you for visiting our store!</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
